  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and my second son is setting up a grain market for himself and he is getting ready to go out with his friends and he is getting a new wife and he is buying a house and everything that he has in his heart and he is buying it and he is getting ready for a great wedding and he is getting his mother and his daughters and his sisters and he is going to get ready for the wedding,\"",
